  "title": "Organic Edunet Linked Open Data",
  "description": {
    "en": "Organic Edunet Linked Open Data currently contains the metadata of collection of learning objects exposed through the Organic.Edunet portal. These objects come from organizations that have become providers of educational materials on the portal. The topics of the collection include organic agriculture and agroecology."
